search index=cloud sourcetype=o365:management:activity Operation=UserLoginFailed
``` Template: Microsoft 365 / Entra ID sign-in failures (Splunk Add-on for Microsoft Office 365). ```
       ErrorNumber IN (50053, 50126, 50034, 50055, 50057)
``` Modele : echecs de connexion Microsoft 365 / Entra ID (Splunk Add-on for Microsoft Office 365).
    A ADAPTER : index. Codes : https://learn.microsoft.com/entra/identity-platform/reference-error-codes ```
| eval src_ip = if(match(ClientIP, "^\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+:\d+$"), replace(ClientIP, ":\d+$", ""), ClientIP)
| eval signature = case(ErrorNumber == 50053, "Compte verrouillé",
                        ErrorNumber == 50126, "Mot de passe invalide",
                        ErrorNumber == 50034, "Compte inexistant",
                        ErrorNumber == 50055, "Mot de passe expiré",
                        ErrorNumber == 50057, "Compte désactivé",
                        true(),               "Échec d'authentification"),
       severity = case(ErrorNumber == 50053,          "critical",
                       ErrorNumber IN (50126, 50034), "high",
                       true(),                        "medium")
``` cible : le domaine de l'identifiant tente (valeur choisie par l'attaquant : la page l'echappe) ```
| eval dest_host = mvindex(split(UserId, "@"), 1), action = "blocked",
       dc = "CLOUD"
| fields _time, src_ip, Country, src_lat, src_lon, dc, severity, signature, dest_host, action
